{% doc %}
  @prompt
    
    SECTION GOAL (match layout + hierarchy):
    - Full-width section with a centered header:
      - Small eyebrow text above the title in uppercase with wide letter spacing, shown like: (HOW WE CAN HELP)
      - Big bold heading: Our Services
    - Below the header: a 4-card services grid (desktop = 4 columns).
    - Each card has:
      - A rounded-square icon badge at the top-left
      - Service title
      - Short description
    - Style should feel modern/minimal with soft rounded corners and subtle borders/shadows (light theme version of the screenshot).
    
    DESIGN SPECS (WHITE THEME):
    - Section background: #FFFFFF
    - Container max-width: 1200–1280px; centered
    - Section padding: ~80–96px top/bottom
    - Eyebrow:
      - text-transform: uppercase
      - letter-spacing: 0.22em
      - font-size: 12–13px
      - color: #6B7280
      - displayed with parentheses around the text
      - margin-bottom: 10–14px
    - Heading (h2):
      - font-weight: 700
      - size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 54px)
      - color: #111827
      - margin-bottom: 44–56px
    
    CARDS (match proportions + spacing):
    - Grid:
      - desktop: 4 columns
      - tablet: 2 columns
      - mobile: 1 column
      - gap: 20–28px
    - Card:
      - background: #FFFFFF (or #F9FAFB for subtle contrast — pick what looks best)
      - border: 1px solid #E5E7EB
      - border-radius: 22–26px
      - padding: 26–30px
      - min-height similar to screenshot, and all cards equal height
      - subtle shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(17,24,39,0.08) (light and soft)
      - hover: slightly lift (translateY(-2px)) + slightly stronger shadow
    - Icon badge:
      - size: 52px
      - border-radius: 14px
      - background: #F3F4F6
      - icon stroke/fill: #111827
      - spacing under icon: 16–18px
    - Card title:
      - font-size: 18–20px
      - font-weight: 600–700
      - color: #111827
      - margin-bottom: 8–10px
    - Card description:
      - font-size: 14–16px
      - line-height: 1.55
      - color: #6B7280
    
    CONTENT (default 4 cards exactly like screenshot):
    1) Brand Strategy
       Comprehensive brand development from positioning to visual identity.
    2) AI Automation
       Custom workflows and AI solutions to scale your operations.
    3) Content Production
       High-impact content from photography to full video production.
    4) Growth Marketing
       Data-driven campaigns that drive real business results.
    
    ICONS:
    - Use inline SVGs (no external libraries) for these 4 default icons:
      - globe
      - bolt
      - document/page
      - users/group
    - Add a block setting to choose icon type (select: globe, bolt, document, users), plus optional “Custom SVG” textarea that overrides the icon if provided.
    
    SHOPIFY REQUIREMENTS:
    - Output: COMPLETE section code only (no explanation), including:
      - Liquid markup
      - Scoped CSS inside the section (use a unique wrapper class like .services-grid-section)
      - JSON schema with:
        - Section settings: eyebrow_text, heading_text, background_color (default #fff), heading_color, eyebrow_color
        - Block settings: title, description, icon_select, custom_svg, link_url (optional)
        - Presets: include 4 default blocks with the text above
    - Accessible, semantic HTML:
      - <section> with aria-label
      - Use a list for cards (ul/li)
      - If link_url is set, make the whole card clickable but keep focus styles visible
    
    Make it look as close as possible to the screenshot’s spacing and “card row” feel—just converted to a bright white, clean, modern aesthetic.
    , can you make this on mobile a carrousel view than staggered. also add a way to add a background if wanted to, it can barely fit via mobile. please format this that it does
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .services-grid-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: 80px 20px;
    width: 100%;
    {% if block.settings.background_image %}
      background-image: url('{{ block.settings.background_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .services-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .services-grid-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
  }

  .services-grid-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .services-grid-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 54px);
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .services-grid-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .services-grid-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  .services-grid-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.12);
  }

  .services-grid-card-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .services-grid-icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: {{ block.settings.icon_background }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .services-grid-icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .services-grid-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .services-grid-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_description_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .services-grid-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .services-grid-carousel-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .services-grid-carousel-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
  }

  .services-grid-carousel-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .services-grid-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .services-grid-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 16px;
    }

    .services-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0;
    }

    .services-grid-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .services-grid-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
      overflow: visible;
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .services-grid-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      gap: 16px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .services-grid-carousel-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-width: 100%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .services-grid-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .services-grid-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

